# Balance domain

Canonical formula: `docs/SPEC.md` § Balance Projection Algorithm.

- Pure function, one account, no I/O. UI calls a single helper.
- `currentBalance` already includes posted auto-income/expense. Future dates: no occurrence yet.
- Purchases on `asOfDate` are already in the balance — do not subtract again.
- Future incomes, expense rules, planned spend: interval `(asOfDate, targetDate]`.
- Recheck on create and on edit of amount/date/account (exclude the edited purchase).
- If `!canAfford`: refuse; banner + drawer; offer transfer from another of the user's accounts when surplus ≥ shortfall.
- «Свободно до пополнения»: `balance − planned − future expense rules` with dates strictly before next income.
- All accounts: one nearest income date; same formula to that date; skip transfers between included accounts.
- «Готово» по покупке: один расход и одно списание. Skip/adjust auto-post must not re-apply that date.
